---
name: panels/inbox-list
description: "Panel line: when the model should answer from the user's reminders/inbox."
version: 1
output: json
variables: []
---
inbox_list {scope: unread|all} whenever the request involves the user's reminders or inbox (list them, find a reminder, plan around them). Renders their REAL rows, so it is the only component allowed to answer with inbox content. scope: unread ONLY when the user asks for what is still pending; all otherwise. Always send scope inside props.
